raph","text":"きっとCMを見てびっくりしているだろうなー🥳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、みなさんもエナジーレベルを引き上げて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張りましょう〜〜🧚‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい💤"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-41018":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のおわりはスイカとあだち充"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ども。ポカです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0918_1_ffh83h8fh89hfe98hf849hf84h.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おひさまのみなみなさま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアー１発目の広島ありがとうございました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もみまんポカで写真撮ってくれる人たくさんで\n嬉しさしかなかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週からの福岡もよろしくなのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんななか～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ってか」MV200万回突破しました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めでたいよね～\nソフトクリーム食べたくなるよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか\n「ポカが映り込んでいるのでは？論争」\nがまきおこっていることもこみみに挟みました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな疑問を解決する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ってかQ＆Aブログ vol.1」をお届け～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q1. MVで映ってるこれはポカですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0918_2_fk0fkewkwfpkfowkeofe.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.\nちがいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く知らない 出たがりなとりです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカも隙あらば狙っていたのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オトナたちにがっつり両羽を抑えられてたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノー出演でフィニッシュでした～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q２.ラストの人参モンスターはいったいなんなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0918_3_sjiwjdiojwifdjwfjfjfw.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ポカもわからないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、\nカントクがノリノリで「キャロット～！」と\n叫んでるのはチラ見してました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さいごのスタッフクレジットにいるこの子がカントクの原画みたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q３.ポカのお気に入りのシーンはどこですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0918_4_fjjf9jf9jf9f94ww4j99j0w.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.いっぱいあるので、マニアックなとこいくつか紹介するです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずひとつめは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"潮のじゃんぷりょく～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクロバットすぎて、これもCGなのかとおもいました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つづいて、ふたつめ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0918_5_jw9fj9fewj9jejw9fewj9wfe.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとりだけテンションおかしい子が隠れているのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと かとしは無人島でサバイバルになっても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで生きのこるタイプ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q４.いろんな場所にメンバーが描いたモンスターが隠れてるって本当ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ほんとうです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２１体かくれているのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はとくべつに、ひとつだけこたえを～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0918_6_ffh83h8fh89hfe98dj9j239dj90j3d2jd3d2.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いじょーにたっぴつな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風船のとこにいるキャラは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おすしのモンスター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"性格出るよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画伯すぎるものから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは盛ってるで～なやつまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もりだくさんなので、\n場所ふくめ、だれがどれを描いたかも当ててみて欲しいのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解は発売日らへんで発表する予定～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい答えてきましたが、\nもしききたい質問があれば、#pokablogまで～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットは、\n今オトナたちが頑張っているそうなので、\nまたごじつ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よい３連休を～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-60049":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"🎧ハイウェイ/羊文学さん"},{"type":